  "starterCode": "# GELU Activation — reconstructed educational contract\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef solution(x):\n    # TODO: implement the operation described in the problem statement\n    pass\n",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nThe implementation computes **GELU Activation** by following direct architectural principles, leveraging vectorized operations to ensure both correctness and optimal runtime efficiency.\n\n### ⚡ Python Reference Implementation\n```python\nimport numpy as np\ndef solution(x):\n    x=np.asarray(x,dtype=float)\n    # GPT-2 tanh approximation to GELU.\n    y=0.5*x*(1+np.tanh(np.sqrt(2/np.pi)*(x+0.044715*x**3)))\n    return y.tolist()\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ where $N$ represents the primary sequence length or dimension.\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ auxiliary memory for computing and storing output representations.",
